            "detailed_description": "Dodge Master is a high speed test of reflexes that will challenge your dodging ability throughout the experience. You play as a white block that you must guide through a series of levels that will really test your hand-eye coordination skills. Dodge Master features a lot of variety, you could be going through a maze one level while ducking into alcoves to avoid being crushed in the next.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50+ Handcrafted Levels<br></li><li>Alternate Gravity<br></li><li>Unique Bosses<br></li><li>Bouncy Blocks<br></li><li>Locks and Keys<br></li><li>Randomly Generated Levels</li></ul>",
